Body:
Local MCPs are not recognized or listed either on Linux. The MCP process is running and connected via sockets but not showing up in the GUI and it is not invoked when asking e.g. to index a directory.  This seems to be a desktop app MCP issue, I can access the MCP with external scripts. Here is my config snippet:

```
  "mcp": {
    "rag-server": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["/usr/bin/python3", "mcp-rag-server.py"],
      "enabled": true,
      "timeout": 15000
    }
  }
```
Related to https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/30600 which was fixed lately.
